                            <div class="entry-content"><h4>First biodistribution study of the complete nanoparticle</h4><p>In mice, CancerVax evaluated where its complete nanoparticle distributed and reported lower liver stress markers than with conventional lipid nanoparticles.</p><div class="actions"><a class="text-link" href="/single-news.php?id=49">Read press release <svg class="arrow" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 12 4M5.5 4H12v6.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a></div><details><summary>View figure</summary><div class="figures"><figure><a href="<?php echo $full_url; ?>assets/images/progress2/progress-june2026-image1.png" class="figure-link" aria-label="Enlarge figure: Biodistribution study figure for the complete nanoparticle"><img loading="lazy" src="<?php echo $full_url; ?>assets/images/progress2/progress-june2026-image1.png" alt="Biodistribution study figure for the complete nanoparticle"></a><figcaption>Biodistribution of the complete nanoparticle</figcaption></figure></div></details></div>
