                            <div class="entry-content"><h4>Cell-targeting lipid nanoparticle produced</h4><p>Independent analysis confirmed attachment of Marker1 to the surface of the lipid nanoparticles. This established a delivery component for the complete formulation.</p><div class="actions"><a class="text-link" href="/single-news.php?id=35">Read press release <svg class="arrow" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 12 4M5.5 4H12v6.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="/webinar-may-31-2025"><span class="play" aria-hidden="true"></span> Watch video</a></div><details><summary>View figure</summary><div class="figures"><figure><a href="<?php echo $full_url; ?>assets/images/progress2/marker1-nanoparticle.webp" class="figure-link" aria-label="Enlarge figure: Illustration of the CancerVax lipid nanoparticle with Marker1 surface tags"><span class="marker-figure"><img loading="lazy" src="<?php echo $full_url; ?>assets/images/progress2/marker1-nanoparticle.webp" alt="Illustration of the CancerVax lipid nanoparticle with Marker1 surface tags"><svg class="marker-annotation" viewBox="0 0 1490 1055" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1085 186 L1190 107 H1218" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M1085 186 L1190 107 H1218" fill="none" stroke="#164963" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="1085" cy="186" r="7" fill="#164963" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="1214" y="77" width="210" height="61" rx="14" fill="#164963"/><text x="1319" y="120" fill="white" text-anchor="middle" font-size="43" font-weight="700">Marker1</text></svg></span></a><figcaption>Illustration of the lipid nanoparticle with Marker1 surface tags</figcaption></figure></div></details></div>
